=== google-takeout 00000000-0000-88ab-b54c-6183150810df Gemini
--- chunk 0
title: Gemini | text: Me — Sat 14 Feb 2026 18:48

Tell me about the Prime Directive. Is it ever waived?

📎 Prime Directive summary.txt — 97 B


--- chunk 1
title: Gemini | text: Gemini — Sat 14 Feb 2026 18:48

The Prime Directive (General Order 1) prohibits Starfleet personnel from interfering with the natural development of pre-warp civilizations.

> "No interference with the internal development of alien civilizations."

Captains have set it aside, but never without a court of inquiry after.


--- chunk 2
title: Gemini | text: Me — Tue 3 Mar 2026 16:15

Make this saucer sketch look like the Enterprise-D at warp.

saucer-sketch.jpg


--- chunk 3
title: Gemini | text: Gemini — Tue 3 Mar 2026 16:15

Here is the Enterprise-D at warp.

2364030112000000001-ncc1701d0e5f6a7b.jpeg


--- chunk 4
title: Gemini | text: Me — Sun 5 Apr 2026 17:15

How does a warp coil work?


--- chunk 5
title: Gemini | text: Gemini — Sun 5 Apr 2026 17:15

A warp coil generates an asymmetric subspace field around the ship, allowing faster-than-light travel without local time dilation.

*   **Verterium cortenide** windings shape the field.
*   The coils fire in sequence, front to back.


